{"type":"message","id":"5146ccbb","parentId":"b246c3b2","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:26:18.807Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b6366de642ae4eb8ac3d0afa","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"CLIProxyAPI\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 923,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"975f1ac2b205f00f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nrouter-for-me/CLIProxyAPI - GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"975f1ac2b205f00f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a266cc0e7ea0c84b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIntegrates CLIProxyAPI to provide OAuth authentication for Codex, Claude, Gemini, Antigravity, and Qwen Code, with built-in and third-party provider rerouting through a single proxy endpoint - no API keys needed for OAuth providers.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a266cc0e7ea0c84b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1168c0decf18ac7a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCLIProxyAPI\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1168c0decf18ac7a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://help.router-for.me/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1406509306261b4d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCLIProxyAPI An OpenAI/Gemini/Claude/Codex compatible API service What is CLIProxyAPI ?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1406509306261b4d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"help.router-for.me\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4b51378fb356dfd4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\ngithub.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/v6 - Go Packages\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4b51378fb356dfd4\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/v6\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"84e620b527154d4c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCLIProxyAPI Quota Inspector Ready-to-use cross-platform quota inspector for CLIProxyAPI , supporting per-account codex 5h/7d quota windows, plan-based sorting, status coloring, and multi-account summary analytics. [!NOTE] If you developed a project based on CLIProxyAPI , please open a PR to add it to this list. More choices\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"84e620b527154d4c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"pkg.go.dev\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3ca1cd641441744c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nClipProxy: Turn AI CLI Subscriptions into OpenAI-Compatible APIs\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3ca1cd641441744c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fazm.ai/blog/clipproxy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a45771ba149f19b8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to set up CLIProxyAPI (cliproxy) to expose ChatGPT, Claude Code, and Gemini CLI as OpenAI-compatible API endpoints with OAuth, load balancing, and failover.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a45771ba149f19b8\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fazm.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3425605503d00710\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nrouter-for-me/CLIProxyAPI | DeepWiki\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3425605503d00710\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://deepwiki.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0a88a44952460ac1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCLIProxyAPI is a unified proxy gateway for multiple AI provider APIs, exposing OpenAI-compatible endpoints to CLI tools and IDE extensions. It provides multi-account management, OAuth authentication, request translation, dynamic configuration hot-reload, and automatic credential failover.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0a88a44952460ac1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"deepwiki.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"CLIProxyAPI","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":923,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"975f1ac2b205f00f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nrouter-for-me/CLIProxyAPI - GitHub\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"975f1ac2b205f00f\">>>","url":"https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a266cc0e7ea0c84b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIntegrates CLIProxyAPI to provide OAuth authentication for Codex, Claude, Gemini, Antigravity, and Qwen Code, with built-in and third-party provider rerouting through a single proxy endpoint - no API keys needed for OAuth providers.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a266cc0e7ea0c84b\">>>","siteName":"github.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1168c0decf18ac7a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCLIProxyAPI\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1168c0decf18ac7a\">>>","url":"https://help.router-for.me/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1406509306261b4d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCLIProxyAPI An OpenAI/Gemini/Claude/Codex compatible API service What is CLIProxyAPI ?\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1406509306261b4d\">>>","siteName":"help.router-for.me"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4b51378fb356dfd4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\ngithub.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/v6 - Go Packages\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4b51378fb356dfd4\">>>","url":"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/v6","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"84e620b527154d4c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCLIProxyAPI Quota Inspector Ready-to-use cross-platform quota inspector for CLIProxyAPI , supporting per-account codex 5h/7d quota windows, plan-based sorting, status coloring, and multi-account summary analytics. [!NOTE] If you developed a project based on CLIProxyAPI , please open a PR to add it to this list. More choices\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"84e620b527154d4c\">>>","siteName":"pkg.go.dev"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3ca1cd641441744c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nClipProxy: Turn AI CLI Subscriptions into OpenAI-Compatible APIs\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3ca1cd641441744c\">>>","url":"https://fazm.ai/blog/clipproxy","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a45771ba149f19b8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHow to set up CLIProxyAPI (cliproxy) to expose ChatGPT, Claude Code, and Gemini CLI as OpenAI-compatible API endpoints with OAuth, load balancing, and failover.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a45771ba149f19b8\">>>","siteName":"fazm.ai"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3425605503d00710\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nrouter-for-me/CLIProxyAPI | DeepWiki\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3425605503d00710\">>>","url":"https://deepwiki.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0a88a44952460ac1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCLIProxyAPI is a unified proxy gateway for multiple AI provider APIs, exposing OpenAI-compatible endpoints to CLI tools and IDE extensions. It provides multi-account management, OAuth authentication, request translation, dynamic configuration hot-reload, and automatic credential failover.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0a88a44952460ac1\">>>","siteName":"deepwiki.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776266778806}}
{"type":"message","id":"46736cdf","parentId":"5146ccbb","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:27:07.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"根据搜索结果，我找到了 CLIProxyAPI 的信息。让我给开发者总结一下。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"根据搜索结果，**CLIProxyAPI** 是一个 AI API 代理网关工具，主要作用如下：\n\n## 🟢 建议 - CLIProxyAPI 简介\n\n### 核心功能\n\n| 功能 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **统一代理** | 将多个 AI 提供商的 API 统一为 OpenAI 兼容格式 |\n| **OAuth 认证** | 支持 Codex、Claude、Gemini、Qwen 等的 OAuth 登录，无需 API Key |\n| **多账号管理** | 支持多账号管理、配额查看、负载均衡 |\n| **故障转移** | 自动切换到可用的备用账号 |\n| **热重载** | 配置更改无需重启 |\n\n### 使用场景\n\n- 将 **ChatGPT CLI**、**Claude Code**、**Gemini CLI** 等转换为 OpenAI 兼容 API\n- 在不支持官方 API Key 的工具中使用这些 AI 服务\n- 集中管理多个 AI 账号的配额\n\n### GitHub 地址\n\n> https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI\n\n---\n\n🔗 开发者，你是在项目中遇到了这个工具，还是想了解如何集成它？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776266778808,"responseId":"021776266780316fca2acf2a78f0a6ac3c14349a42ec1de830d5b"}}
